<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>CASA NATURAL</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Fermentos, jabones y rituales cotidianos. Talleres reducidos de masa madre y cosmética natural en Madrid." />

    <!-- Para que el enlace se vea bonito en WhatsApp e Instagram -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="CASA NATURAL" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Fermentos, jabones y rituales cotidianos. Talleres reducidos en Madrid." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://casanatural.studio/hero.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://casanatural.studio" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300&family=Courier+Prime&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style is:global>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { overflow-x: hidden; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>

    <audio id="ambiente" loop>
      <source src="/audio-siesta.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" />
    </audio>
    <script>
      window.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const audio = document.getElementById("ambiente");
        if (audio instanceof HTMLAudioElement) {
          audio.volume = 0.05;
          audio.play();
        }
      }, { once: true });
    </script>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section style="
      position: relative;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      background-image: url('/hero.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #f3efe6;
      overflow: hidden;
    ">
      <!-- overlay -->
      <div style="
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(20,14,10,0.08), rgba(20,14,10,0.30));
      "></div>

      <!-- contenido central -->
      <div style="
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 0 2rem;
      ">
        <h1 style="
          font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
          font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem);
          font-weight: 400;
          letter-spacing: 0.12em;
          line-height: 1;
          margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        ">CASA NATURAL</h1>

        <p style="
          font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
          font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
          font-style: italic;
          font-weight: 300;
          opacity: 0.88;
          margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
        ">Fermentos, jabones y rituales cotidianos.</p>

        <a href="#contenido" style="
          display: inline-block;
          border: 1px solid rgba(243,239,230,0.5);
          padding: 1rem 2.8rem;
          color: #f3efe6;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
          font-size: 0.72rem;
          letter-spacing: 0.2em;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          transition: 0.3s ease;
        ">Entrar en la casa</a>
      </div>

      <!-- pie del hero -->
      <div style="
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 2rem;
        z-index: 2;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        opacity: 0.7;
      ">MADRID · TALLERES REDUCIDOS</div>
    </section>

    <!-- MANIFIESTO -->
    <section id="contenido" style="
      background: url('/textura.webp'), #F5F1EA;
      background-size: 700px;
      background-repeat: repeat;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.4), inset 0 -40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
      padding: 90px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    ">
      <div style="
        position: absolute; inset: 0;
        background:
          radial-gradient(ellipse at top left, rgba(0,0,0,0.035), transparent 55%),
          radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, rgba(0,0,0,0.03), transparent 60%);
        pointer-events: none;
      "></div>
      <p style="
        max-width: 700px; margin: auto; color: #2E2A27;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.4rem);
        line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-align: center;
        opacity: 0.96; font-weight: normal;
        text-shadow: 0 0 0.4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); filter: contrast(0.95);
      ">
        Creemos en los rituales cotidianos.<br /><br />
        En las casas donde todavía fermentan cosas.<br /><br />
        En el olor del pan, las hojas y el jabón secándose lentamente.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- LA COCINA -->
    <section style="background: #F5F1EA; padding: 80px 0 90px 0;">
      <div style="width: 88%; margin: auto;">
        <img src="/cocina.webp" alt="Manos amasando pan de masa madre en una cocina con luz natural" style="width: 100%; display: block;" />
      </div>
      <div style="max-width: 700px; margin: 60px auto 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: 0 30px;">
        <div style="
          font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
          letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #5A4E45;
          margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 600;
        ">LA COCINA</div>
        <p style="
          font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #2E2A27;
          font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.2vw, 2.3rem); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 26px;
        ">Una introducción tranquila al mundo de la masa madre.</p>
        <p style="
          font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: #5E534B;
          font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 700px; margin: auto; opacity: 0.9;
        ">Un vídeo para aprender a crearla desde cero, entender sus ritmos y empezar a convivir con ella.</p>
        <div style="margin-top: 46px;">
          <a href="/la-cocina-2" style="
            border: 1px solid rgba(60,50,40,0.25); padding: 18px 34px;
            text-decoration: none; color: #2E2A27;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 0.72rem;
            transition: 0.3s ease; display: inline-block;
          ">Entrar en la cocina</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EL PATIO -->
    <section style="background: #EFE7DC; padding: 80px 0 0 0;">
      <div style="width: 90%; margin: auto;">
        <img src="/patio.webp" alt="Patio mediterráneo con plantas aromáticas y luz de tarde" style="width: 100%; display: block;" />
      </div>
      <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 60px auto 0 auto; text-align: center; padding: 0 30px;">
        <div style="
          font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
          letter-spacing: 0.18em; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #5A4E45;
          margin-bottom: 18px; font-weight: 600;
        ">EL PATIO</div>
        <p style="
          font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #2E2A27;
          font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.2vw, 2.3rem); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 26px;
        ">Los meses tienen olor.</p>
        <div style="
          font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: #5E534B;
          font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 700px;
          margin: auto; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 60px;
        ">
          <p>JULIO · albahaca · limón · piedra caliente</p>
          <p>AGOSTO · hoja de higuera · leche tibia · sombra fresca</p>
          <p>SEPTIEMBRE · tierra húmeda · mosto · aire frío</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="/footer-textura.webp" alt="" style="
        width: 100vw; margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw); display: block; margin-top: 0;
      " />
    </section>

  </body>
</html>
